    },
    {
      "id": "878a0478-f91",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 980,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 25,
      "text": "Infrastructure & Services",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "fontStyle": "bold",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent"
    },
    {
      "id": "9c780123-b61",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 980,
      "y": 850,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 310,
      "text": "New Deployments:\n• PBU (Policy-Based Unit)\n  - TC GTP, RADIUS\n  - Enrichment\n  \n• Redis\n  - In-memory caching\n  - Session management\n\n⚠️ CRITICAL QUESTION:\nDoes PBU support dual-\ndelivery patterns?\n\nLegacy Migration:\nCRS → MFM\n(Message Flow Manager)",
      "fontSize": 9,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc67390b-2b3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 1230,
      "width": 1400,
      "height": 30,
      "text": "✓ SUCCESS CRITERIA",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "fontStyle": "bold",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent"
    },
    {
      "id": "8c2a3cec-d49",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 1270,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "Block 1:\n✓ All small sites deployed & validated\n✓ All large sites upgraded with G.16 TBOS\n✓ Legacy equipment repurposed for MDE/SAU\n✓ Dual-delivery tested (19.X + 22.14 concurrent)\n✓ 72-hour burn-in passes (zero errors)\n\nBlock 2:\n✓ Kubernetes infrastructure operational\n✓ PBU + Redis deployed & validated\n✓ SAU multi-domain delivery functional\n✓ MDE dual-delivery tested across all plugins\n✓ CRS→MFM migration complete\n✓ Load testing passes (both backends)\n✓ Failover/recovery scenarios validated",
      "fontSize": 9,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "backgroundColor": "#D4FFDB"
    },
    {
      "id": "f83dc7a2-2c5",
