    },
    {
      "id": "fcba1a9d-376",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 1590,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "Block 1:\n□ Confirm G.16 quantity (Owner: Haver, Nesi)\n□ Approve reshuffling plan (Owner: Haver, Nesi + Finkel, Lev)\n□ Validate legacy TBOS fitness for reuse\n\nBlock 2:\n□ MSMQ vs Kafka for SAU→New UDC (Owner: Keren, Zhaneta) — Timeline Impact: HIGH\n□ Complete list of MDE dual-delivery plugins (Owner: Issler, Shlomo)\n□ PBU dual-delivery capability review (All stakeholders)",
      "fontSize": 9,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
